id: psycho-thread
name: Psycho Thread
advancement: true
prerequisite: Insight Score 10+
tpCost: 10
# "When your Opponent loses Life Points through the effects of your use of the Binding Unique Ability, they lose Ki
# Points equal to 1/2 of the amount of Life Points lost."
drainsKi: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Life Points your Binding takes cost them half as many Ki Points too.
text: >
  Psycho Thread: You can use your energy ensnaring an opponent to slowly sap them of their strength.
  –Prerequisites: Insight Score 10+
  –TP Cost: 10
  –Effect: When your Opponent loses Life Points through the effects of your use of the Binding Unique Ability, they
  lose Ki Points equal to 1/2 of the amount of Life Points lost.
